{"id":"n83149-1-7","stage":5,"title":"커플 · 情侣","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83149-1-7-1","ko":"승규와 지수는 왜 저렇게 연인처럼 붙어 다니는 거니?","zh":"承奎和智秀为什么像情侣一样黏在一起啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규와","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；와：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"승규와","audio":"/audio/0c4b5c638074f7fef732.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"저렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"저렇다","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71226","senseId":"1","lemma":"저렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연인처럼","meaning":"恋人","explanation":"연인：恋人；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"연인","audio":"/audio/13447c06bce8a5aa591b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14022","senseId":"1","lemma":"연인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"붙어","meaning":"挨，靠，连","explanation":"붙다：挨，靠，连；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"붙다","audio":"/audio/25c69080a9810c70a4d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74181","senseId":"10","lemma":"붙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다니는","meaning":"来往，走遍，","explanation":"다니다：来往，走遍，；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"4","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거니?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"07e99c1628a5077b","term":"저렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3","entryId":"71226","definition":"性质、模样、状态等与那个一样。","pronunciation":["저러타"]},{"id":"13447c06bce8a5aa","term":"연인","zh":"恋人","audio":"/audio/13447c06bce8a5aa591b.mp3","entryId":"14022","definition":"相爱交往的男子和女子。","pronunciation":["여ː닌"]},{"id":"25c69080a9810c70","term":"붙다","zh":"挨，靠，连","audio":"/audio/25c69080a9810c70a4d0.mp3","entryId":"74181","definition":"物与物或人与人相互贴近。","pronunciation":["붇따"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"来往，走遍，","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"到处走动。","pronunciation":["다니다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/476fa4e456394a4aafd9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83149-1-7-2","ko":"몰랐어? 쟤네 원래 커플이잖아.","zh":"不知道吗？他们本来就是一对啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"몰랐어?","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쟤네","meaning":"“저 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","explanation":"쟤：“저 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。；네：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"쟤","audio":"/audio/07345a466b2427d03046.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71213","senseId":"1","lemma":"쟤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"원래","meaning":"原来，本来","explanation":"원래：原来，本来","readings":[{"term":"원래","audio":"/audio/dc5331dd64d187d4a0fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53768","senseId":"1","lemma":"원래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"커플이잖아.","meaning":"情侣","explanation":"커플：情侣；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"커플","audio":"/audio/b853c6c2fb57e4130a64.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83149","senseId":"1","lemma":"커플","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"07345a466b2427d0","term":"쟤","zh":"“저 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/07345a466b2427d03046.mp3","entryId":"71213","definition":"“저 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"dc5331dd64d187d4","term":"원래","zh":"原来，本来","audio":"/audio/dc5331dd64d187d4a0fd.mp3","entryId":"53768","definition":"从一开始；或指从根本上。","pronunciation":["월래"]},{"id":"b853c6c2fb57e413","term":"커플","zh":"情侣","audio":"/audio/b853c6c2fb57e4130a64.mp3","entryId":"83149","definition":"配成一对的男女。","pronunciation":[]}],"audio":"/audio/96b6b08be7ebd57d8297.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.331,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83149","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":151,"sequenceScore":2.9844,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["承奎和智秀为什么像情侣一样黏在一起啊？","不知道吗？他们本来就是一对啊。","显示说网络连接不上呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["承奎和智秀为什么像情侣一样黏在一起啊？","不知道吗？他们本来就是一对啊。","显示说网络连接不上呢。"],"answer":1}]}
